WEBVTT

00:04.020 --> 00:06.210
Just what kind of relationship do Samatarou and I have?

00:06.770 --> 00:08.290
Ye-yeah...
Ye-yeah...

00:09.440 --> 00:11.330
I'm back again!

00:12.350 --> 00:13.050
Why...?

00:13.900 --> 00:16.930
I came back to see you.

00:17.560 --> 00:20.750
Just what do I mean to Samatarou?

00:21.200 --> 00:22.760
Please, go out with me.

00:26.060 --> 00:29.560
I'm gonna... go out with Kumiko?

00:31.460 --> 00:34.730
Why does her face have to come up at a time like this?

00:34.870 --> 00:36.870
What? Does that mean no?

00:37.070 --> 00:40.010
No, not like that...

00:40.540 --> 00:41.040
Then...

00:41.400 --> 00:42.780
Ye... yeah.

00:44.520 --> 00:46.370
I'm so glad! Great!

00:49.810 --> 00:53.410
This was best for Tenko, too... right?

01:13.510 --> 01:18.830
dare mo shiranai basho de

01:13.510 --> 01:18.830
In a place unknown to everyone

01:19.650 --> 01:24.510
asa ga umare hajimeru

01:19.650 --> 01:24.510
The dawn is being born

01:24.870 --> 01:30.950
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

01:24.870 --> 01:30.950
The wishes you made upon a star

01:30.950 --> 01:36.850
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

01:30.950 --> 01:36.850
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

01:37.150 --> 01:45.760
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

01:37.150 --> 01:45.760
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

01:48.950 --> 01:52.080
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

01:48.950 --> 01:52.080
And my voice envelops the entire world

01:52.100 --> 01:55.170
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

01:52.100 --> 01:55.170
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

01:55.190 --> 01:58.100
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

01:55.190 --> 01:58.100
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

01:58.350 --> 02:01.240
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

01:58.350 --> 02:01.240
And you'll never really lose them

02:01.240 --> 02:04.320
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

02:01.240 --> 02:04.320
My fingers touch all of creation

02:04.320 --> 02:09.710
tobira akete haruka kanata e

02:04.320 --> 02:09.710
Open the door and escape to a distant place

02:28.520 --> 02:31.320
Slowest speed sub ever.

02:28.520 --> 02:31.320
The Heart of Tears Held within the Pink Bank

02:36.790 --> 02:40.640
Samatarou! Did you finish whatever you had to do with Kumiko?

02:41.280 --> 02:42.270
Well, yeah.

02:43.610 --> 02:44.340
Then let's go home!

02:47.080 --> 02:47.750
Samatarouu?

02:48.410 --> 02:49.730
Um, that's...

02:50.090 --> 02:50.740
It's fine.

02:52.210 --> 02:54.660
I'm going home with Kumiko from now on.

02:57.920 --> 02:59.670
What's that... mean?

03:00.650 --> 03:03.690
I've decided to start going out with Kumiko.

03:08.190 --> 03:11.890
O-oh. That's good.

03:12.800 --> 03:15.830
After all, you liked Kumiko, right?

03:16.470 --> 03:17.210
Yeah.

03:19.020 --> 03:19.740
Which means...

03:20.450 --> 03:23.040
You don't need me anymore?

03:23.220 --> 03:25.340
It's not like... that, but...

03:28.390 --> 03:29.330
I got it.

03:29.650 --> 03:31.850
Okay, I'll go ahead and go home.

03:47.060 --> 03:49.960
Kamiyama, umm... Tenko....

03:51.050 --> 03:52.040
It's okay.

03:52.830 --> 03:55.150
It's nothing you should be worried about.

04:03.290 --> 04:04.940
JERK JERK JERK JERK!

04:05.340 --> 04:09.830
SAMATAROU, YOU IDIOT!

04:10.060 --> 04:10.720
What?

04:10.720 --> 04:11.580
What's wrong?

04:11.660 --> 04:14.860
Earthquake? Lightning?  Fire? Hurt your thumb?

04:19.980 --> 04:21.350
MAMA~~

04:21.800 --> 04:23.430
What's wrong, Tenko?

04:23.430 --> 04:25.430
I can't understand if you just keep crying like that.

04:27.180 --> 04:29.230
There, there, don't cry, Tenko.

04:29.380 --> 04:33.870
You know, yoga is good for a troubled heart, yoga!

04:35.600 --> 04:37.130
WARABU TAKANO POSE!

04:39.350 --> 04:42.850
That's right, Tenko, you're an angel.

04:43.270 --> 04:45.240
You always have to stay composed.

04:45.930 --> 04:50.570
If you're all worked up like that, you can't protect Samatarou.

04:54.840 --> 04:55.930
Perfect!

04:55.930 --> 04:58.100
Mama was super-maternal right there!

05:00.250 --> 05:02.720
Why? Did I say something wrong?

05:03.160 --> 05:03.880
Then here, how about this?

05:04.770 --> 05:06.030
Fish pose!

05:06.520 --> 05:08.390
Now dog pose!

05:08.920 --> 05:10.840
Now dancer pose!

05:14.240 --> 05:18.660
Samatarou said he didn't need to be protected!

05:20.070 --> 05:21.600
Samatarou did what now?

05:22.160 --> 05:26.140
Samatarou... said he didn't need to be protected anymore...

05:27.000 --> 05:32.030
Kumiko came back from Osaka and they started going out.

05:32.630 --> 05:34.870
WHAT DID YOU SAY?

05:35.020 --> 05:39.930
I CANT FORGIVE HER! I CANT FORGIVE THAT CHOROMI BITCH!

05:41.200 --> 05:43.050
Not Choromi, it's Kumiko.

05:43.050 --> 05:46.030
I don't care if it's Kumiko or Tamiko, I can't forgive her!

05:46.480 --> 05:48.750
Okay, okay, that's enough from you two.

05:49.240 --> 05:52.700
You're in the way, so if you want to continue, get a room.

05:53.260 --> 05:54.990
You have to listen!

05:54.990 --> 05:58.930
This Choromi girl stole away our Samatarou!

05:58.930 --> 05:59.460
What should we do?

05:59.730 --> 06:00.990
What should we do, Misa?

06:01.250 --> 06:02.960
Jeez, calm down a little.

06:03.600 --> 06:08.690
Samatarou chose to go out with Kumiko on his own, right?

06:09.000 --> 06:10.020
Is that true, Tenko?

06:10.440 --> 06:13.970
Y-yeah... but...

06:14.680 --> 06:16.810
You know, Tenko.

06:17.220 --> 06:18.090
Yes?

06:18.410 --> 06:20.750
What do you want to end up doing?

06:22.010 --> 06:23.690
Even if you ask me what I want to do...

06:24.400 --> 06:25.220
You don't want that, do you?

06:25.460 --> 06:30.180
You definitely don't want Samatarou going out with some girl like her, do you?

06:30.410 --> 06:33.410
Shut up for a second, Mama. I'm asking Tenko.

06:33.460 --> 06:34.380
O-Okay.

06:34.790 --> 06:37.160
Kumiko and Samatarou are going out.

06:37.780 --> 06:40.470
Okay, Tenko, now what do you want to do?

06:41.410 --> 06:44.300
I... well, I...

06:45.450 --> 06:48.540
If Samatarou is happy, then that's enough for me.

06:49.040 --> 06:51.570
Well then, that's settled.

06:51.950 --> 06:53.160
Okay, we're done.

06:55.010 --> 06:57.250
Why is Misa so cold?

06:58.900 --> 07:00.760
If Samatarou is happy...

07:01.820 --> 07:04.070
Then that's enough... for me...

07:09.050 --> 07:11.240
Thank you for taking me back home.

07:11.690 --> 07:15.620
Well, you know, I figured... Since it's been so long and all...

07:21.160 --> 07:23.420
This is where you live?

07:23.780 --> 07:25.490
Yeah. Is that surprising?

07:26.080 --> 07:27.680
Oh, no, not really.

07:27.680 --> 07:30.790
Old houses like this are nice, too.

07:31.970 --> 07:33.480
Well, I'm going home.

07:34.960 --> 07:35.650
Um...

07:37.160 --> 07:39.750
Do you think you could come upstairs with me for a little bit?

07:40.980 --> 07:45.130
My mom's here, but you don't have to be careful or anything.

07:45.940 --> 07:50.260
But you know, going up to your place on the first day we're dating seems...

07:53.270 --> 07:55.130
I'm sorry for being so selfish.

07:55.700 --> 07:59.540
But I just wanted to be with you a little longer.

08:00.080 --> 08:03.570
Is this what being a couple is like?

08:04.970 --> 08:06.450
Can you... not?

08:07.640 --> 08:11.510
Well, I guess I'll intrude for just a little.

08:11.560 --> 08:12.150
Really?

08:14.650 --> 08:15.510
That's great!

08:16.010 --> 08:18.250
I didn't know what I'd do if you refused.

08:26.080 --> 08:27.080
This isn't bad.

08:27.780 --> 08:29.880
This isn't bad at all!

08:31.950 --> 08:33.550
Mom, I'm home!

08:33.990 --> 08:35.920
Pardon the... intrusion.

08:36.610 --> 08:37.740
Welcome back.

08:49.050 --> 08:52.450
Oh, are you Kamiyama?

08:52.620 --> 08:55.070
Yes, I'm Kamiyama Samatarou.

08:55.310 --> 08:57.890
Kumiko and I are... um...

08:59.050 --> 09:01.980
Kumiko is always talking about you.

09:01.880 --> 09:05.340
Hey, Mom! You don't need to say stuff like that.

09:05.430 --> 09:06.470
You not feeling well, right?

09:06.470 --> 09:07.340
You should go back to sleep.

09:07.560 --> 09:08.690
Okay, okay.

09:08.940 --> 09:12.300
Kamiyama, it's not a big place, but try to make yourself comfortable.

09:18.340 --> 09:21.310
You've been telling her about me?

09:21.950 --> 09:22.360
Yeah.

09:26.460 --> 09:28.170
I told her there was someone I was interested in.

09:29.380 --> 09:30.660
Oh, you don't need to!

09:30.880 --> 09:34.160
Your mom didn't look so well, and I shouldn't stay too long...

09:35.050 --> 09:38.980
Don't worry about my mother. She's always like that.

09:40.260 --> 09:42.650
I don't take good enough care of her.

09:43.760 --> 09:49.040
I keep thinking that if I work a little harder, it'll make things easier on her, but...

09:50.430 --> 09:51.610
Kumiko.

09:52.230 --> 09:56.070
I kept running away from that by saying I wanted to concentrate on studying.

09:56.690 --> 10:02.050
I can't really say that anymore, so I've decided to start working since last month.

10:04.510 --> 10:05.180
Here you go.

10:07.570 --> 10:08.460
What a good girl!

10:08.520 --> 10:10.890
What a good, good girl!

10:10.940 --> 10:11.970
Kumiko!

10:12.140 --> 10:12.880
Y..es?

10:13.210 --> 10:15.840
If there's anything I can do, please tell me!

10:16.010 --> 10:16.800
I'll help out!

10:18.640 --> 10:19.920
Okay.

10:20.780 --> 10:22.230
Thank you very much.

10:27.890 --> 10:28.730
I'm back!

10:30.110 --> 10:31.100
What is that?

10:32.920 --> 10:34.770
ARABURU TAKANO POSE

10:35.200 --> 10:36.080
Oh, that's what it is.

10:36.630 --> 10:38.430
I'll be heading to my room now.

10:38.630 --> 10:40.160
You're not going anywhere.

10:42.350 --> 10:44.840
Samatarou, where have you been all this time?

10:44.840 --> 10:48.590
Mama and Tenko have been very worried about you!

10:48.770 --> 10:50.240
It doesn't matter where I was.

10:50.610 --> 10:53.410
That's not right, you were at Choromi's place. You were, huh?!

10:53.410 --> 10:54.890
Confess!

11:01.050 --> 11:02.510
Samatarou!

11:07.030 --> 11:08.260
Jeez, Ma...

11:09.740 --> 11:10.440
Sis?

11:10.600 --> 11:12.460
Welcome back, Samatarou.

11:14.780 --> 11:17.510
Why are you sleeping on my bed?

11:17.940 --> 11:19.270
That's cold.

11:19.840 --> 11:23.410
I was waiting all this time for you to come home, too.

11:23.540 --> 11:25.610
You were waiting? Why?

11:26.750 --> 11:29.930
You've started going out with Kumiko, right?

11:31.010 --> 11:33.290
Yeah. Is there something wrong with that?

11:34.570 --> 11:36.100
What'll you do with Tenko?

11:36.320 --> 11:38.100
Can you just ignore her?

11:38.600 --> 11:40.400
Tenko doesn't have anything to do with this.

11:41.230 --> 11:43.380
She and I are an angel and a god.

11:43.770 --> 11:45.010
We're just childhood friends.

11:45.730 --> 11:50.780
Who I go out with and who she goes out with is our own business.

11:52.900 --> 11:55.550
You two really are alike.

11:56.930 --> 11:58.160
What does that mean?

12:00.550 --> 12:03.620
You're not honest, or maybe it's just you're both thick.

12:04.310 --> 12:05.910
I said it's not like that.

12:06.850 --> 12:08.820
It's not my problem if you regret this.

12:08.870 --> 12:10.620
I won't regret this.

12:11.640 --> 12:16.300
Oh well. If you won't regret it, then I won't say anything.

12:16.890 --> 12:20.000
Just don't make Tenko cry too much, okay?

12:24.300 --> 12:27.010
What's your problem, coming into my room without even asking?

12:27.390 --> 12:29.010
Just say what you want to say!

12:29.260 --> 12:30.420
She's such a pain.

12:38.610 --> 12:40.260
Tenko, huh...

13:01.440 --> 13:03.980
I'm not in love with Samatarou.

13:05.410 --> 13:06.990
I'm not in love with him at all, but...

13:07.170 --> 13:10.640
I'm going out with Kumiko from now on.

13:12.570 --> 13:15.260
I'm so through with people like him!

13:15.430 --> 13:17.930
Oh, so you're ready?

13:19.350 --> 13:20.340
You again?!

13:20.720 --> 13:21.510
Get out!

13:21.580 --> 13:23.600
Get out of my head!

13:23.990 --> 13:27.680
Samatarou will be fine without your help.

13:28.120 --> 13:30.090
You're no longer needed.

13:31.030 --> 13:34.020
Is that true... is that really true?

13:34.730 --> 13:39.870
He has Kumiko, and he's getting along with her and becoming independent...

13:40.730 --> 13:43.340
Maybe he doesn't need an angel as a babysitter anymore.

13:44.060 --> 13:47.170
That's right. Give up. Now's the time.

13:49.640 --> 13:51.510
Do as you're obliged to do and go back to Heaven!

13:51.760 --> 13:53.630
Your duty here has ended!

13:55.710 --> 13:56.370
Really?

13:58.550 --> 14:00.420
I'm not needed anymore.

14:03.360 --> 14:06.200
Okay. I'll go back to Heaven.

14:06.590 --> 14:08.760
Okay, then I'll take care of the formalities now.

14:09.090 --> 14:10.690
Thank you for all the hard work.

14:11.300 --> 14:12.320
But, wait a second.

14:12.320 --> 14:14.220
Please, just give me three more days.

14:14.440 --> 14:16.120
Let me stay here for three more days!

14:16.540 --> 14:19.770
Why? You just decided to finish your duty as an angel!

14:20.210 --> 14:23.380
No! Not as an angel or a guardian....

14:23.910 --> 14:28.240
For just three days as a regular girl... I want to see Samatarou!

14:31.000 --> 14:34.130
Please! I've worked so hard for all this time!

14:34.300 --> 14:35.560
Just give me three days...

14:36.430 --> 14:37.410
Understood.

14:37.660 --> 14:41.070
Then, you henceforth formally agree to return to Heaven after three days.

14:41.590 --> 14:43.660
Until then, you may do as you wish.

14:45.060 --> 14:46.430
Thank you very much!

14:46.620 --> 14:50.940
However! There is absolutely no way you can go back on this promise!

14:51.340 --> 14:53.160
This is a contract with me!

14:53.550 --> 14:55.830
You WILL come back to Heaven after three days.

14:56.590 --> 14:57.610
Understood?

14:59.450 --> 15:00.050
Yes.

15:02.710 --> 15:05.360
I thought I heard a sound from over here...

15:07.870 --> 15:08.680
What's this?

15:14.960 --> 15:16.140
A piggy bank?

15:16.580 --> 15:18.140
I wonder if there's money inside.

15:19.670 --> 15:20.750
H-hey, stop that!

15:22.670 --> 15:24.030
You shook me too much.

15:24.180 --> 15:26.950
AHH! THE PIGGY BANK IS TALKING!

15:29.310 --> 15:31.900
Owww.....

15:36.990 --> 15:38.220
It's flying.

15:38.550 --> 15:40.150
The piggy bank is flying!

15:40.280 --> 15:43.750
Tenko, you need to keep me a secret.

15:43.980 --> 15:46.820
I don't want to cause trouble to any of the Kamiyama family.

15:47.480 --> 15:51.680
What are you? Are you the one that's been talking to me all this time?

15:52.170 --> 15:54.410
That's right. My name is Suguru.

15:55.150 --> 15:58.290
Like you, I'm an angel, but I am a much greater archangel.

15:58.960 --> 16:01.330
Archangel? A piggy bank?

16:01.470 --> 16:03.840
I'M NEITHER A PIG NOR A BANK!

16:04.310 --> 16:08.360
I just transformed myself into the least noticeable thing in human society!

16:08.410 --> 16:09.130
Here, have this.

16:10.510 --> 16:11.440
That's 50 yen.

16:11.880 --> 16:13.640
You're a talking piggy bank!

16:13.640 --> 16:14.650
That's so cute!

16:15.020 --> 16:18.330
I just told you, I'm not a piggy bank, I'm a archangel.

16:18.330 --> 16:22.890
I just happen to have to say how much money someone puts in my back, every time...

16:23.480 --> 16:24.470
That's 200 yen.

16:24.620 --> 16:26.570
In total, you have 250 yen.

16:28.050 --> 16:29.920
T-the pig is calculating the total!

16:29.920 --> 16:32.240
I JUST SAID THAT I'M NOT A PIG. I'M AN ARCHANGEL!

16:35.140 --> 16:36.290
Just a little longer...

16:36.940 --> 16:42.020
Just for a little longer... I can live as just a girl and watch Samatarou, right?

16:47.530 --> 16:50.060
WHY DID MY ALARM CLOCK STOP ON ITS OWN?

16:50.060 --> 16:55.290
You don't have any duties as a guardian angel anymore, so I took it upon myself to turn off your alarm.

16:55.450 --> 16:57.080
DON'T DO THINGS LIKE THAT ON YOUR OWN!

16:57.820 --> 17:00.580
If I'm not around, no one will make breakfast!

17:04.700 --> 17:09.560
That's right. I'm not going to make everyone's breakfast for much longer.

17:10.950 --> 17:11.640
Hey, Suguru.

17:12.060 --> 17:12.590
What is it?

17:14.450 --> 17:17.980
When I go back to Heaven, will I meet my real family?

17:18.250 --> 17:20.370
There's no need to think about things like that.

17:20.660 --> 17:24.990
As long as you're here, you should just treasure your time with the Kamiyama family.

17:25.700 --> 17:27.160
But I really do worry about it.

17:27.700 --> 17:30.690
I don't remember much about Heaven.

17:31.100 --> 17:34.760
I don't remember anything about my Papa or my Mama.

17:35.550 --> 17:36.710
What is a family?

17:37.220 --> 17:39.370
Those connected to you just by blood?

17:39.970 --> 17:40.780
No?

17:41.280 --> 17:45.570
No. Those who always watch over and protect you. That's family.

17:45.990 --> 17:47.980
Those who protect you...

17:49.490 --> 17:50.630
IT'S ALREADY THIS LATE!

17:53.490 --> 17:56.110
I'm going ahead, but you wait here.

17:56.580 --> 17:58.320
If someone discovers you, you're in trouble, right?

17:58.790 --> 18:03.610
Hm. If a piggy bank is flying around, the Kamiyama family would find it strange.

18:03.960 --> 18:05.560
In that case, it'd be a problem.

18:05.860 --> 18:07.410
It'd be a problem? Why?

18:08.100 --> 18:11.160
They'll probably figure out that I'm an angel...

18:11.480 --> 18:16.460
And then they might figure out that since an angel is around, they must be here to take you back.

18:16.940 --> 18:18.880
In that case, I'll be in trouble.

18:19.010 --> 18:19.620
Oh yeah.

18:19.840 --> 18:20.790
Okay, then I'll be leaving.

18:21.520 --> 18:22.660
Wait just a second!

18:23.100 --> 18:24.090
W-what is it?

18:26.780 --> 18:27.970
I'm thirsty.

18:27.970 --> 18:29.420
Give me something to drink.

18:29.540 --> 18:34.380
Later. I'm really busy in the mornings, and I don't have a single second to spare.

18:34.870 --> 18:35.130
Oh.

18:37.270 --> 18:38.450
Meme?

18:41.590 --> 18:43.880
Um, you know, Meme, that's...

18:44.130 --> 18:44.620
Here.

18:46.680 --> 18:47.790
That's 100 yen.

18:47.900 --> 18:49.760
In total, you have 350 yen.

18:57.180 --> 18:59.980
It seems like she just brushed off you being here like it was nothing.

19:01.090 --> 19:03.650
Indeed, that's Meme for you. She's so cool!

19:04.760 --> 19:05.130
Hm?

19:05.900 --> 19:07.450
Tenko? Tenko??

19:08.830 --> 19:11.130
Jeez... I sure am running late.

19:12.780 --> 19:13.740
Give me some cola.

19:14.860 --> 19:19.330
What are you doing? Won't you be in trouble if someone finds you?

19:19.490 --> 19:20.230
Cola!

19:20.710 --> 19:21.910
Tenko!

19:22.160 --> 19:25.420
Good morning! Today's the ballerina pose!

19:27.090 --> 19:27.980
Hmm?

19:31.640 --> 19:33.940
Oh my, oh my. Here you go!

19:35.560 --> 19:36.480
That's 200 yen.

19:36.870 --> 19:38.690
In total, you have 550 yen.

19:39.710 --> 19:42.380
Piggy banks these days are amazing!

19:42.640 --> 19:45.240
Charichari, piggy bank!

19:45.920 --> 19:47.750
Mama didn't notice either.

19:48.080 --> 19:49.500
What do you mean, you'll be found out?

19:50.020 --> 19:51.160
I was worried for nothing.

19:51.560 --> 19:52.290
Shut up!

19:52.570 --> 19:55.870
The goddess is just pretending not to notice!

19:56.140 --> 19:57.500
No, you're wrong.

19:57.630 --> 19:59.500
That's 100% not faking it.

20:03.530 --> 20:06.380
C'mon... even Misa found out about you.

20:06.580 --> 20:07.200
Defeat.

20:07.200 --> 20:11.570
Don't just say that, it's because you're just flying around everywhere!

20:17.090 --> 20:19.270
Okay, okay.

20:21.150 --> 20:22.420
That's 150 yen.

20:22.520 --> 20:24.180
In total, you have 700 yen.

20:25.460 --> 20:26.500
I got it, I got it!

20:26.950 --> 20:27.930
Good boy, good boy.

20:31.580 --> 20:34.150
I wonder what Misa just figured out from that.

20:34.390 --> 20:35.660
I have no idea.

20:35.660 --> 20:37.360
It's an absolute mystery.

20:38.190 --> 20:41.160
So in the end, no one has figured you out.

20:41.360 --> 20:44.020
That's strange, that shouldn't be the case...

20:44.020 --> 20:45.470
Hey, Tenko?

20:48.560 --> 20:49.570
THAT PIG IS FLYING!

20:49.570 --> 20:52.390
Yeah, yeah! Now that's a reasonable reaction.

20:52.710 --> 20:54.110
Oh well, if that's the case...

20:54.380 --> 20:55.380
Here you go.

20:55.890 --> 20:56.700
That's 100 yen.

20:56.830 --> 20:58.340
In total, you have 800 yen.

20:58.800 --> 20:59.760
Is that fine with him?

21:00.060 --> 21:02.630
Oh yeah, I won't be needing breakfast.

21:02.700 --> 21:03.760
Why not?

21:04.980 --> 21:07.520
I promised to have a morning date with Kumiko.

21:07.660 --> 21:08.850
A morning date?

21:08.850 --> 21:09.460
That's right!

21:09.830 --> 21:11.370
We're eating breakfast together!

21:14.690 --> 21:15.900
You can't do that, Tenko!

21:16.130 --> 21:18.230
You'll only be together with Samatarou for a little bit longer.

21:18.670 --> 21:21.850
You need to look at Samatarou with loving eyes for that time!

21:21.960 --> 21:23.700
Oh, really?

21:23.830 --> 21:25.730
A morning date with Kumiko.

21:26.660 --> 21:29.300
Okay, have fun!

21:29.750 --> 21:33.750
Oh no, I'm late. I promised to have a talk with her before that.

21:34.120 --> 21:35.210
A talk?

21:35.840 --> 21:39.000
I don't want to keep Kumiko waiting, so I'll be off!

21:42.380 --> 21:44.440
Hey, Tenko. Tenko.

21:47.550 --> 21:48.280
Tenko?

21:51.610 --> 21:52.510
WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?

21:52.510 --> 21:55.250
WHAT'S A MORNING DATE AND A TALK?

21:55.250 --> 21:59.100
I thought you said you didn't like him like that!

21:59.100 --> 22:02.160
I DONT LIKE HIM, I DONT LIKE HIM AT ALL, BUT...

22:06.920 --> 22:08.690
He really pisses me off.

22:09.530 --> 22:10.500
I'll be going now!

22:12.670 --> 22:13.730
We're going, Suguru.

22:13.730 --> 22:15.160
Going where?

22:15.600 --> 22:16.490
That should be damn obvious.

22:20.410 --> 22:22.070
Spying, man! Spying!

22:40.300 --> 22:45.790
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.300 --> 22:45.790
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.660 --> 22:52.250
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.660 --> 22:52.250
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.660 --> 22:56.640
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.660 --> 22:56.640
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.500 --> 23:04.240
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.500 --> 23:04.240
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.750 --> 23:10.940
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.750 --> 23:10.940
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.180 --> 23:17.530
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.180 --> 23:17.530
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.410 --> 23:24.650
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.410 --> 23:24.650
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.920 --> 23:31.870
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.920 --> 23:31.870
Oh please, God! Allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.870 --> 23:37.600
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.870 --> 23:37.600
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.630 --> 23:39.480
kotaenasai

23:37.630 --> 23:39.480
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.510 --> 23:47.290
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.510 --> 23:47.290
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.330 --> 23:52.460
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.330 --> 23:52.460
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:03.750 --> 24:06.260
I'm so glad that I could do this with you, Kamiyama...

24:06.260 --> 24:08.160
So that's a morning date?

24:08.160 --> 24:09.670
Don't interfere, Tenko!

24:09.670 --> 24:12.390
It's only a coincidence.  Sometimes people happen to hear things.

24:12.390 --> 24:13.470
What's going on?

24:13.600 --> 24:15.600
Everyone else was late...

24:15.740 --> 24:17.150
Everyone had the same dream.

24:17.150 --> 24:19.840
Tenko, the moon tonight is beautiful.

24:20.030 --> 24:20.800
Kumiko....

24:21.150 --> 24:24.210
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku:
Midnight Girl

24:25.220 --> 24:27.860
KUMIKO.. KUMIKO'S AFTER ME!
